{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32180","headline":"经西坞偶题 · 温庭筠","name":"经西坞偶题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摇摇弱柳黄鹂啼，芳草无情人自迷。\n日影明灭金色鲤，杏花唼喋青头鸡。\n微红柰蔕惹蜂粉，洁白芹芽穿燕泥。\n借问含嚬向何事，昔年曾到武陵溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}